Auth related:


Login:
POST request:

localhost:8000/
	Url: app_url/api/login
	Request:
		{
	Email: “”,
	password:””
}
	Response (200): 
		{
			Token: “”,
			user_data: {} based on the structure of user model
			role : “”
}

Logout:
POST req:
	URl: app_url/api/logout
	Auth headers: JWT_token
	No request body needed







Data Related:

ALL requests:
	CFO:
Return All EOs (GET)
Return All employee ( inc, PMOs, Bottom level employees, directors) (GET)
Return All task (GET)
Change or add PMOs managing an EO (PUT)

	PMO:
Return All Tasks Related to his EO only (GET)
He won’t be able to gell all tasks of other EOs
Return All Employees under him (GET)
Return all Daily_updates from all the employees under him (via emails) (GET)
Change/Remove an Assignee from task (PUT)

	Employees:
Return all updates that he posted (Via emails or dashboard) (GET)
Return all active tasks that he’s working under right now (GET)
Add an Daily_task update (POST)




